flowchart LR
  Recovery[1 Recovery plans] --> Edge[2 Gateway / Armor / IP]
  Edge --> Delivery[3 Delivery / attestor]
  Delivery --> Workloads[4 Workloads / PVC]
  Workloads --> Addons[5 Addons]
  Addons --> Cluster[6 GKE / node pools]
  Cluster --> Platform[7 Registry / data / SQL]
  Platform --> Network[8 NAT / VPC]
  Network --> Verify[9 Independent resource inventory]
  Verify --> Final{Final teardown?}
  Final -->|yes| State[Delete remote state]
  State --> Billing[Unlink billing]
  Billing --> Project[Delete project]
